                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1164800                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  SELEKTERAR ALLA ARTIKLAR MED ERSÄTTNINGSKOD > 20.     *        
*                INGÅR I BESTÄLLNINGSRUTIN W116S1 SOM STARTAS VIA      *        
*                VCOM-TRANS.                                           *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  KENT JEBSEN                                           *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  OKTOBER  97                                           *        
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*        FILE SECTION                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11648D1                                                                   
%W01160                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W11648D2                                                                   
%W11642   'IN42-'                                                               
*                                                                               
FILE W11648D3                                                                   
%W11645   'IN45-'                                                               
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  TEMP FILES                          *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
FILE TEMPFIL1 FB (8 0) VIRTUAL                                                  
%W11645   'TMP1-'                                                               
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  UTFIL                               *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11648D4 FB (13 0)                                                         
%W11648    (UT-)                                                                
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  SYSINPUT                            *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE SYSINPUT                                                                   
PARM-BESTLAND            1   2 A                                                
*                                                                               
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  WORKING STORAGE                     *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
 WS-BESTLAND              W  2 A   VALUE '  '                                   
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*      JOB INPUT                       *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W11648D2 KEY (IN42-IDARTNR)        +                                 
           W11648D3 KEY (IN45-IDARTNR))                                         
                                                                                
 IF MATCHED                                                                     
    TMP1-W11645-CTX   = IN45-W11645-CTX                                         
    PUT TEMPFIL1                                                                
 ELSE                                                                           
    IF W11648D2 AND IN42-KDERS < 20                                             
       TMP1-IDARTNR      = IN42-IDARTNR                                         
       TMP1-KDERS        = IN42-KDERS                                           
       TMP1-FLERSATT     = 'N'                                                  
       PUT TEMPFIL1                                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
 END-IF                                                                         
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*      SORT TEMP FILE                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
SORT TEMPFIL1 TO TEMPFIL1 USING (TMP1-IDARTNR)                                  
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*      JOB INPUT                       *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W11648D1 KEY (CLAG-IDARTNR)        +                                 
           TEMPFIL1 KEY (TMP1-IDARTNR))       +                                 
                                   START A-INIT                                 
                                                                                
 IF MATCHED                                                                     
  IF CLAG-KDERS > 0  OR CLAG-KDERS-UTG > 0                                      
     UT-IDARTNR        = CLAG-IDARTNR                                           
     UT-KDERS          = TMP1-KDERS                                             
     UT-TIERSDAT       = CLAG-TIERSDAT                                          
     UT-KDPRODSL       = CLAG-KDPRODSL                                          
     UT-FLERSATT       = TMP1-FLERSATT                                          
     PUT W11648D4                                                               
  END-IF                                                                        
 END-IF                                                                         
                                                                                
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
                                                                                
 GET SYSINPUT                                                                   
 MOVE PARM-BESTLAND TO WS-BESTLAND                                              
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
